    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple Bloom filter over int64_t (<ref refid="namespacethemisdb_1_1temporal_1a020dc4059404c27c809d05b54399b803" kindref="member">Timestamp</ref>) values. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses 3 independent hash functions derived from Murmur3-style finalizers. Default sizing: 8 bits per expected element → ~2.4 % false-positive rate.</para>
<para>Used in <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_version_block" kindref="compound">VersionBlock</ref> to short-circuit getAsOf() calls that cannot possibly match (warm-tier miss detection). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
